// Sum of the labeled margins on the kept pairs.
// No pair returns nothing. A zero margin adds nothing.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE msum ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG msum rank

IMPULSE msum 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "msum" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
